    "detailed_description": "<strong>Be the pirate lord of Crow\u2019s Nest!</strong><br>Establish and rule over your own pirate's haven in this immersive city builder game. As the mastermind behind it all, ensure your crew of hardy pirates has all they need to live, thrive, and improve their quarters on your island. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051210/extras/afb82e1bbc3c065e1a649182bb561d2e.poster.avif?t=1706315920\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051210/extras/afb82e1bbc3c065e1a649182bb561d2e.webm?t=1706315920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Resource Acquisition</strong><br>Managing a pirate base isn't only about building - it's about smart acquisition. Goods and resources captured from your sea exploits are important, but they are just part of your growing inventory. Cultivate your island, reap its resources, and ensure your stockpile is always full to keep your pirate base thriving. <br><br><strong>Establish Order and Fear</strong><br>Your swashbucklers have captured prisoners during their high-seas adventures who are the lifeblood of your island's development. Maintain control through order and fear. Be careful though, you must meet their basic needs to prevent mutiny.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051210/extras/c719d91a0588dc3a87534dde79f3e813.avif?t=1706315920\" /></div><br><br><strong>Develop Your Refuge</strong><br>Provide your crew with plots of land for building and upgrading their own homes. Also, construct taverns for them to enjoy good food and drinks, keeping their spirits high.<br><br><strong>Seize the Seas</strong><br>Your crew thrives on piracy. They don't build ships - they seize them, growing the fleet under your flag. Use these captured vessels for further exploits, bringing wealth and resources back to your base.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051210/extras/8890d97b8ef25465cd5243ddd268c2e4.poster.avif?t=1706315920\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051210/extras/8890d97b8ef25465cd5243ddd268c2e4.webm?t=1706315920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051210/extras/8890d97b8ef25465cd5243ddd268c2e4.mp4?t=1706315920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Be the pirate lord of Crow\u2019s Nest!</strong><br>Establish and rule over your own pirate's haven in this immersive city builder game. As the mastermind behind it all, ensure your crew of hardy pirates has all they need to live, thrive, and improve their quarters on your island. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051210/extras/afb82e1bbc3c065e1a649182bb561d2e.poster.avif?t=1706315920\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051210/extras/afb82e1bbc3c065e1a649182bb561d2e.webm?t=1706315920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Resource Acquisition</strong><br>Managing a pirate base isn't only about building - it's about smart acquisition. Goods and resources captured from your sea exploits are important, but they are just part of your growing inventory. Cultivate your island, reap its resources, and ensure your stockpile is always full to keep your pirate base thriving. <br><br><strong>Establish Order and Fear</strong><br>Your swashbucklers have captured prisoners during their high-seas adventures who are the lifeblood of your island's development. Maintain control through order and fear. Be careful though, you must meet their basic needs to prevent mutiny.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051210/extras/c719d91a0588dc3a87534dde79f3e813.avif?t=1706315920\" /></div><br><br><strong>Develop Your Refuge</strong><br>Provide your crew with plots of land for building and upgrading their own homes. Also, construct taverns for them to enjoy good food and drinks, keeping their spirits high.<br><br><strong>Seize the Seas</strong><br>Your crew thrives on piracy. They don't build ships - they seize them, growing the fleet under your flag. Use these captured vessels for further exploits, bringing wealth and resources back to your base.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051210/extras/8890d97b8ef25465cd5243ddd268c2e4.poster.avif?t=1706315920\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051210/extras/8890d97b8ef25465cd5243ddd268c2e4.webm?t=1706315920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2051210/extras/8890d97b8ef25465cd5243ddd268c2e4.mp4?t=1706315920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
